{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Co-op roguelike of absurd hauntings, light horror, and questionable teamwork.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a gang of ghost convicts who just broke out of a magical medieval prison-castle. The plan is simple: <strong>run the corridors, grab what you can, and escape</strong> before an unstoppable entity called <strong>Death</strong> eats the level behind you. The reality is\u2026 chaos, yelling, and a lot of improv possession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2\u20134 player online co-op</strong> \u2022 <strong>30\u201340 min runs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.poster.avif?t=1774660191\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.webm?t=1774660191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.mp4?t=1774660191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possession as core gameplay (not a gimmick).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re ghosts\u2014<strong>become the room</strong>. Possess swords to launch shockwaves, chandeliers to pancake mobs, armor suits to tank, barrels to go boom, or wall levers to flip traps against enemies. Possessed items gain <strong>their own active skills</strong> (short, punchy, and useful), and many fights/boss shields are designed to be cracked <i>via</i> the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.poster.avif?t=1774660191\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.webm?t=1774660191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.mp4?t=1774660191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-based, not grind-based.</strong><br>There\u2019s <strong>no permanent power</strong>. Each escape attempt is its own buildcraft puzzle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Cards:</strong> regular \u201cpick 1 of 3\u201d stat/perk choices (HP, damage, move speed, quirks).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Books:</strong> draft your 4-skill kit from what you find\u2014respec by replacing a slot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Skills from Possession:</strong> the object you inhabit <i>is</i> a temporary weapon with its own acts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbiote Slot:</strong> unique Symbiote skill that changes how you approach big moments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because everything resets, <strong>risking an optional challenge</strong> to spike your build <i>this</i> run actually matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/37a06f401e90fac9e1549f9f90d56dc0.avif?t=1774660191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras_big/37a06f401e90fac9e1549f9f90d56dc0.avif?t=1774660191 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural corridors</strong> remix combat spaces each run. Scattered throughout are <strong>Elite Locations</strong>\u2014high-stakes side areas packed with <strong>top-tier loot</strong>. Worth the detour\u2026 if you can stay ahead of <strong>Death</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/795194f74d7b1f1764ffae79e3462584.avif?t=1774660191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras_big/795194f74d7b1f1764ffae79e3462584.avif?t=1774660191 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949460?t=1774660191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949460?t=1774660191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/b0b2234b103c944a5c2ab3f93cf8d52c178cb219/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774660191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/b0b2234b103c944a5c2ab3f93cf8d52c178cb219/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774660191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4098580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Co-op roguelike of absurd hauntings, light horror, and questionable teamwork.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a gang of ghost convicts who just broke out of a magical medieval prison-castle. The plan is simple: <strong>run the corridors, grab what you can, and escape</strong> before an unstoppable entity called <strong>Death</strong> eats the level behind you. The reality is\u2026 chaos, yelling, and a lot of improv possession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2\u20134 player online co-op</strong> \u2022 <strong>30\u201340 min runs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.poster.avif?t=1774660191\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.webm?t=1774660191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.mp4?t=1774660191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possession as core gameplay (not a gimmick).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re ghosts\u2014<strong>become the room</strong>. Possess swords to launch shockwaves, chandeliers to pancake mobs, armor suits to tank, barrels to go boom, or wall levers to flip traps against enemies. Possessed items gain <strong>their own active skills</strong> (short, punchy, and useful), and many fights/boss shields are designed to be cracked <i>via</i> the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.poster.avif?t=1774660191\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.webm?t=1774660191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.mp4?t=1774660191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-based, not grind-based.</strong><br>There\u2019s <strong>no permanent power</strong>. Each escape attempt is its own buildcraft puzzle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Cards:</strong> regular \u201cpick 1 of 3\u201d stat/perk choices (HP, damage, move speed, quirks).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Books:</strong> draft your 4-skill kit from what you find\u2014respec by replacing a slot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Skills from Possession:</strong> the object you inhabit <i>is</i> a temporary weapon with its own acts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbiote Slot:</strong> unique Symbiote skill that changes how you approach big moments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because everything resets, <strong>risking an optional challenge</strong> to spike your build <i>this</i> run actually matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/37a06f401e90fac9e1549f9f90d56dc0.avif?t=1774660191\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras_big/37a06f401e90fac9e1549f9f90d56dc0.avif?t=1774660191 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural corridors</strong> remix combat spaces each run. Scattered throughout are <strong>Elite Locations</strong>\u2014high-stakes side areas packed with <strong>top-tier loot</strong>. Worth the detour\u2026 if you can stay ahead of <strong>Death</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394946