08008700eb2b2ea881d6610/ss_f41c0fd4f1668d71308008700eb2b2ea881d6610.600x338.jpg?t=1774660191"}],"short_description":"Phantom Fools is a co-op third-person action roguelike for 1\u20134 players as poltergeist ghosts. Possess objects and use their powers, find magic books and random upgrade cards, climb procedurally generated castle tiers, and escape the dungeon!","steam_appid":3949460,"support_info":{"email":"lollikovich@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Ukrainian, Japanese, Russian","type":"game","website":null}